{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >About this Demo</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this demo, you can enjoy all the features available in the full version for free.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >(<i>Please note: save data will not carry over to the full version.</i>)</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game Overview</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Summoner's Pieces</strong> is a new kind of competitive game that fuses  <br><strong>puzzle mechanics</strong>, <strong>deck-building</strong>, and <strong>auto-battler</strong> elements.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4039060/extras/8de5c703a9b853cb0e9609ef20ddbb83.poster.avif?t=1758286345\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4039060/extras/8de5c703a9b853cb0e9609ef20ddbb83.webm?t=1758286345\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4039060/extras/8de5c703a9b853cb0e9609ef20ddbb83.mp4?t=1758286345\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The rules are simple:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Drag pieces from your hand onto the summoning board. When all the tabs (\u51f8) on a piece are successfully connected, the unit or spell sealed within that piece is summoned onto the battlefield.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Piece Types</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The more tabs a piece has, the harder it is to summon \u2014 but the stronger it becomes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If your deck is filled only with powerful pieces, it will be difficult to summon them. Make sure to balance your deck with weaker pieces too.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4039060/extras/30d5df4783753fbd8f6685d6b274903f.avif?t=1758286345\" width=1536 height=385 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pieces come in five elemental colors, each with unique tab-and-slot shapes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4039060/extras/ceb9e393f936afe05859bd1030d28b49.avif?t=1758286345\" width=1536 height=385 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are also neutral pieces with no elemental attribute. They consist of common shapes only, making them easier to include in any deck.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4039060/extras/292481c7335ae9f972ef269d643469dd.avif?t=1758286345\" width=1536 height=385 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some pieces are spell pieces that activate an effect immediately when summoned.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4039060/extras/b92aa5b1ff9b156502e27c98e09d1f4f.avif?t=1758286345\" width=1536 height=385 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Auto-Battle</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Once summoned, units with various abilities will automatically battle each other. The player who eliminates all opposing units wins.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4039060/extras/d3426564b7fe4fd36ef41d536efc1233.poster.avif?t=1758286345\" width=800 height=132 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4039060/extras/d3426564b7fe4fd36ef41d536efc1233.webm?t=1758286345\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All you need to do is \u201csolve the puzzle to summon\u201d \u2014 no need to learn complex rules.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you get used to the game, you\u2019ll discover deeper strategies through timing your placements and building your deck.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Rules</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Place a Piece\u00a0</strong>\u2013 Drag a piece onto the summoning board</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Connect All Tabs\u00a0</strong>\u2013 Once all tabs are connected, the sealed unit or spell is summoned</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Auto Battle</strong> \u2013 Summoned units fight automatically; the player who eliminates all opposing units wins</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game Modes</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Online Battles</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Friend Battles</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>CPU Stages / CPU Battles</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Future Plans</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The full version is still in active development.<br>We plan to add more puzzle pieces and additional features at launch.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Adding the game to your wishlist would be greatly appreciated.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4039060?t=1758286345","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4039060/54be5112eefc5eadb9420cf3865bf72d6404b448/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1758286345","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4039060/875bcc535d90b71e9e65dbc917c20dc82d7d3c61/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1758286345","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4039060/875bcc535d90b71e9e65dbc917c20dc82d7d3c61/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1758286345","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"Game demo","id":10},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >About this Demo</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this demo, you can enjoy all the features available in the full version for free.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >(<i>Please note: save data will not carry over to the full version.</i>)</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game Overview</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Summoner's Pieces</strong> is a new kind of competitive game that fuses  <br><strong>puzzle mechanics</strong>, <strong>deck-building</strong>, and <strong>auto-battler</strong> elements.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4039060/extras/8de5c703a9b853cb0e9609ef20ddbb83.poster.avif?t=1758286345\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4039060/extras/8de5c703a9b853cb0e9609ef20ddbb83.webm?t=1758286345\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4039060/extras/8de5c703a9b853cb0e9609ef20ddbb83.mp4?t=1758286345\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The rules are simple:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Drag pieces from your hand onto the summoning board. When all the tabs (\u51f8) on a piece are successfully connected, the unit or spell sealed within that piece is summoned onto the battlefield.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Piece Types</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The more tabs a piece has, the harder it is to summon \u2014 but the stronger it becomes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If your deck is filled only with powerful pieces, it will be difficult to summon them. Make sure to balance your deck with weaker pieces too.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4039060/extras/30d5df4783753fbd8f6685d6b274903f.avif?t=1758286345\" width=1536 height=385 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pieces come in five elemental colors, each with unique tab-and-slot shapes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4039060/extras/ceb9e393f936afe05859bd1030d28b49.avif?t=1758286345\" width=1536 height=385 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are also neutral pieces with no elemental attribute. They consist of common shapes only, making them easier to include in any deck.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4039060/extras/292481c7335ae9f972ef269d643469dd.avif?t=1758286345\" width=1536 height=385 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some pieces are spell pieces that activate an effect immediately when summoned.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4039060/extras/b92aa5b1ff9b156502e27c98e09d1f4f.avif?t=1758286345\" width=1536 height=385 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Auto-Battle</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Once summoned, units with various abilities will automatically battle each other. The player who eliminates all opposing units wins.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4039060/extras/d3426564b7fe4fd36ef41d536efc1233.poster.avif?t=1758286345\" width=800 height=132 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4039060/extras/d3426564b7fe4fd36ef41d536efc1233.webm?t=1758286345\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All you need to do is \u201csolve the puzzle to summon\u201d \u2014 no need to learn complex rules.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you get used to the game, you\u2019ll discover deeper strategies through timing your placements and building your deck.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Rules</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Place a Piece\u00a0</strong>\u2013 Drag a piece onto the summoning board</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Connect All Tabs\u00a0</strong>\u2013 Once all tabs are connected, the sealed unit or spell is summoned</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Auto Battle</strong> \u2013 Summoned units fight automatically; the player who eliminates all opposing units wins</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game Modes</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Online Battles</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Friend Battles</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>CPU Stages / CPU Battles</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Future Plans</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The full version is still in active development.<br>We plan to add more puzzle pieces and additional features at launch.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Adding the game to your wishlist would be greatly appreciated.</p>","developers":["flow Inc.","tackgames"],"fullgame":{"appid":"3837370","name":"Summoner's Pieces"},"genres":[{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4039060/93fc221a091a64a4c4894a3516f951a642f5548e/header.jpg?t=1758286345","is_free":true,"legal_notice":"\u00a9 2025 flow Inc., tackgames","linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> macOS 10.15 (Catalina)<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Apple M1 or Intel Core i3 (2 cores)<br></li><li><strong>Network:</strong> Broadband Internet connection<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 1024 MB available space</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257199183,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257199183/movie480.mp4?t=1758286343","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257199183/movie_max.mp4?t=1758286343"},"name":"First trailer (en)","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257199183/621c35be9d58da0b96063b90d6ebbee627d55bf7/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1758286343","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257199183/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1758286343","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257199183/movie_max_vp9.webm?t=1758286343"}}],"name":"Summoner's Pieces Demo","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 64-bit<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i3-4160\uff0fAMD FX-4350<br></li><li><strong>